## Test Data

Generate synthetic test data to validate the pipeline:

```bash
python scripts/generate_test_data.py --output tests/data/

# Then run the pipeline on it:
bidseq run \
  --treated  tests/data/treated_test.fastq.gz \
  --control  tests/data/control_test.fastq.gz \
  --reference tests/data/rnu4_2_test.fa \
  --output   tests/results/
```

Expected behaviour:
- Positions 4, 72, 79 should be called as Ψ sites (HIGH_CONFIDENCE or MODERATE)
- RENU: VAF ~45%, zygosity HETEROZYGOUS

