## Running Tests

```bash
# Fast unit tests (no external tools needed)
pytest tests/ -v --ignore=tests/test_integration.py

# All tests including integration (requires minimap2 + samtools)
pytest tests/ -v

# With coverage report
pytest tests/ --cov=bidseq --cov-report=html
```

