## Citation / Acknowledgements

This pipeline implements an adaptation of the BID-seq method described in:

> Dai Q. et al. (2023). *Quantitative sequencing using BID-seq uncovers abundant pseudouridines in mammalian mRNA at base resolution.* Nature Protocols. https://doi.org/10.1038/s41596-023-00917-5

Original BID-seq chemistry:
> Dai Q. et al. (2022). *Quantitative sequencing using BID-seq uncovers abundant pseudouridines in mammalian mRNA at base resolution.* Nature Biotechnology. https://doi.org/10.1038/s41587-022-01505-w

RENU syndrome:
> Gillentine M.A. et al. (2024). *De novo variants in RNU4-2 cause a highly recurrent neurodevelopmental syndrome.* Nature. https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-024-07773-7

